      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然还未出道，却展现出了让人期待其未来发展的精彩表现。\n迷人景致！观众席上也传来了热烈的掌声！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2a03328a2b40ba67002a4b6548996a20e1f3433239d20e28b571a992392e8a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
