    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1133220a6b6a666a072bb71b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲜明地让我见识了一番，也让我不禁产生了痛感。\n回想起来——那时也是这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4129763abf22b785374e6703e8f034f7d8a3f13a613bd6b0f4b692e37339df4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
