    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a9d113cb257844b82dc49b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回过神来——已经站在了向往已久的校门口。\n虽然为自己的天真感到羞耻，但还是寻找着她的身影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6e504c32db1f72e95275afff2ef87e26339e9453bfae10a0cb7647c868e45af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
