      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈，这就是同期候补啊……\n简直成了场赔本的买卖……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "020cf9b8fe0e445a746f40cc962d5933a849dd0f72f16b8784fbe46d90deb9e7",
