      "uid": "zhcn:3c7c2da9ae619b94c6a2bb59",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……还想着相互鼓励什么的，简直荒谬。\n学园外，隔着围栏远远望去——她已成为遥不可及的高岭之花。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0387799b0486aa146a0c3c0bfbe4c143af80d9286473a0f3ca2f651030262b28",
